      <title>LumePane 9.1.1</title>
      <pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 10:25:55 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>9.1.1</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>9.1.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description sparkle:descriptionFormat="plain-text"><![CDATA[网站安全与清理
• Externalized the six executable inline test-page scripts; script-src no longer needs 'unsafe-inline' on the site or Cloudflare headers.
• Kept style-src 'unsafe-inline' for now; inline style blocks/attributes still need a separate migration.
• Removed stale 9.0.7 / 9.0.8 / 9.0.9 DMGs from the site mirror; only the current build remains.
软件维护
• Removed low-risk compiler warnings without behavior changes: unused locals, immutable vars, and unnecessary actor hops.
• All gates, 208 server tests, and the nine app self-tests remain green.]]></description>
